%% GET /v1/products/1  (src/catalog/rest/products.controller.ts)
%% NestJS order: middleware, guard, pipe, handler, interceptor.
flowchart LR
  C[GET /v1/products/1 · Postman or app] --> MW[Middleware · counts DB queries]
  MW --> G{Rate limit OK?}
  G -->|no| E429[429 · ThrottlerGuard]
  G -->|yes| P{id is a number?}
  P -->|no| E400[400 · ParseIntPipe]
  P -->|yes| H[Controller · findOne]
  H --> S[CatalogService · findProduct]
  S --> K{In Redis?}
  K -->|hit| HIT[200 from Redis · 0 DB queries]
  K -->|miss| DB[(SELECT product · WHERE id = 1)]
  DB --> F{Found?}
  F -->|no| E404[404 · not cached]
  F -->|yes| SET[Save in Redis · TTL 60s]
  SET --> OK[200 JSON · Cache-Control public]
